flowchart LR
  Admin[Administrator browser] -->|HTTPS| LB[OCI load balancer / ingress]
  subgraph Host[Hosting tenancy - dedicated compartment]
    subgraph OKE[OKE cluster]
      API[API pods\nFastAPI + built React frontend]
      Worker[Worker pods\nPython + Procrastinate]
      Cron[Maintenance CronJobs]
    end
    PG[(OCI Database with PostgreSQL)]
    Vault[OCI Vault\nPer-tenancy keys and passwords]
    LB --> API
    API -->|Transactional reads / writes| PG
    Worker <-->|Claim work / persist results| PG
    Cron -->|Enqueue due work / cleanup| PG
    Worker -->|Read / rotate secrets| Vault
  end
  Worker -->|Organizations API| Parent[Managed parent tenancy]
  Worker -->|Typed OCI facade| Child[1..N child tenancies\nIdentity Domains / IAM\nPolicies / quotas / tags / budgets]
  Parent ---|Organization membership| Child
  Worker -->|Lifecycle and operational notices| Email[Configured email transport]
